# Cloudflare Pages redirects for interlock.sourceshift.ai.
#
# The landing page is built to the root of the deployed directory by
# zensical.landing.toml, which is why this file lives in landing/: the build
# copies it to site/_redirects, the only place Pages reads it. The manual is
# built under /docs/ by zensical.toml.
#
# Rules match top to bottom and the first match wins. Pages follows a
# matching redirect even when a file exists at the source path, so there is
# no catch-all `/* /docs/:splat` (it would match /docs/... itself and loop)
# and no `/assets/*` rule (the landing page's own assets live there). Every
# source below is a path the manual served at the host root before it moved
# under /docs/ on 2026-10-25. The list is frozen: a page added since never
# lived at the root, so it needs no entry here.
#
# Static rules first, then splat rules, as Pages requires.

# The manual's index used to be a page of its own called overview.
/overview /docs/ 301
/overview/ /docs/ 301
/docs/overview /docs/ 301
/docs/overview/ /docs/ 301

/getting-started /docs/getting-started/ 301
/getting-started/ /docs/getting-started/ 301
/concepts /docs/concepts/ 301
/concepts/ /docs/concepts/ 301
/security-model /docs/security-model/ 301
/security-model/ /docs/security-model/ 301

/guides/* /docs/guides/:splat 301
/reference/* /docs/reference/:splat 301
/epics/* /docs/epics/:splat 301
